          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("M’lord, weren’ we waiting for the queen? Your wife had expressed an interest in seeing an orc."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("We can brook no delay, Lionel. The opposing army is finally ready for pitched battle. Ere dusk, my lance will be stained with orcish blood!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("This may prove a learning experience for you, apprentice. Keep your eyes sharp as we guard the fort."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The king commanded us to handle the goblins, master. We could do that by guarding... or we could take a risk and assault the goblin camp."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I know it’s not the caution you usually preach. But I want to be someone, master, not just another wandering healer or village mage. Proving ourselves to the king here could be the first step."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Oh, young one, whatever shall I do with you... If you want to lead the guards against the goblins I won’t stop you, but I’m afraid I can’t help you either. My place is here, tending to the sick and injured."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22methor_limit_movement%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%7B%22applyTo%22%3A%22movement_costs%22%2C%22movementCosts%22%3A%7B%22flat%22%3A999%7D%2C%22replace%22%3Atrue%7D%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Methor",
          },
        ],
