          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Del-fa-dor; Delfador! Thanks master, I like the sound of that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Now farewell, Delfador, my ambitious young friend. If this is what you truly want, I would never stand in your way. May we meet again in more peaceful times."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Yes, yes, well done to you both. Now that that’s settled, “Delfador”, it’s time to pack your bags. You have a long journey ahead of you!"),
